CHECK ui_fiji_panel_chooser_cancel PASS Cancel on the first chooser ended the plugin: cancelled, no run, no worker, no run record
NOTE ui_fiji_panel_copy_empty not run: LC_HOME already holds a last command (state/last_command.json), so the 'nothing to copy yet' state cannot be tested here
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_menu PASS Plugins > LabConstrictor holds ['copy last run as command', 'labconstrictor tools...'] (jar)
NOTE ui_fiji_panel_chooser_app not run: not applicable: only one app is listed, so Fiji shows no app chooser
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_chooser_tool PASS lists ['List the devices', 'Relocalize 2D']; the combo box, OK and Cancel are all it holds; each item selected and read back
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_chooser_ok PASS OK on the tool chooser opened 'List the devices'
CHECK ui_fiji_form_list_devices_opens PASS 0 parameter(s): every declared widget found and nothing else but OK and Cancel; inside the 1600x1000 screen; no other window or dialog
CHECK ui_fiji_form_list_devices_controls PASS the tool declares no parameter: the form holds only OK and Cancel (checked by _opens), so there is nothing to activate
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_form_cancel PASS Cancel on the form ended the plugin: cancelled, no run, no worker, no run record
CHECK ui_fiji_run_list_devices PASS status COMPLETE; every declared result shown (values:values); inputs from case {}
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_log PASS the Log window holds the run's command line and Python snippet, equal to the saved last command
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_form_ok PASS a real click on OK closed the form and the plugin ran the tool (status COMPLETE)
CHECK ui_fiji_screens_list_devices PASS the form and after-run screenshots exist, are fresh and plausible (evidence for a person, not a check of the picture)
CHECK ui_fiji_form_relocalize_opens PASS 32 parameter(s): every declared widget found and nothing else but OK and Cancel; inside the 1600x1000 screen; no other window or dialog
CHECK ui_fiji_form_relocalize_controls PASS 57 control(s) activated and read back: choice_combo, file_browse, flag_checkbox, image_choice, number_spinner, set_checkbox, slider, text_field, use_image_checkbox, use_selection_checkbox
